{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"resume","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A crash in the brief upgrade-era preparation window causes the resumed run to fail and require manual re-queuing."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A resumed needs-human run can fail to open its draft PR, leaving its work stranded in the worktree."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The added regression tests omit the failing recovery paths, but the coverage gap itself has no runtime effect."}]}